5"},"order":0}]},"article":{"headline":"Zibanejad scores twice as Rangers beat Flames 3-1 for 4th win in 5 games","description":"— Mika Zibanejad scored twice in the second period, Joonas Korpisalo made 29 saves and the New York Rangers beat the Calgary Flames 3-1 on Wednesday night for their fourth victory in five games.","story":"CALGARY, Alberta -- — <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/2562637/mika-zibanejad\">Mika Zibanejad</a> scored twice in the second period, <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/3069266/joonas-korpisalo\">Joonas Korpisalo</a> made 29 saves and the <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/team/_/name/nyr/new-york-rangers\">New York Rangers</a> beat the <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/team/_/name/cgy/calgary-flames\">Calgary Flames</a> 3-1 on Wednesday night for their fourth victory in five games.\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4588750/tye-kartye\">Tye Kartye</a>, into an empty net, also scored for New York (11-8-1). \n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/5073306/adam-klapka\">Adam Klapka</a> scored for Calgary (8-10-1). <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4319911/devin-cooley\">Devin Cooley</a> stopped 21 shots.\n\n\r\n              Zibanejad opened the scoring 59 seconds into the second period.\n\n\r\n              Halfway through the second, Zibanejad fired a one-timer on a power play past Cooley after being setup on a cross-ice pass from <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4587588/pavel-dorofeyev\">Pavel Dorofeyev</a>. \n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/3942352/glenn-gawdin\">Glenn Gawdin</a>, who broke into the NHL with the Flames, made his New York debut at fourth-line center. It was his 14th NHL game and first since March 6, 2024.\n\n\r\n              <hl2>Up next</hl2>\r\n              Rangers: At Vancouver on Friday night.\n\n\r\n              Flames: At Los Angeles on Saturday night.\n\n\r\n              ------\n\n\r\n              \r\n                <a href=\"https://apnews.com/hub/nhl\">See AP’s full NHL coverage here</a>","published":"2026-11-12T03:51:43Z"}}